{'symbol': 'CTVA', 'date': '2023-03-28 09:00:00', 'title': 'CORTEVA AGRISCIENCE LAUNCHES ADAVELT™ ACTIVE, BRINGING FARMERS A NEW MODE OF ACTION FUNGICIDE', 'text': 'NOVEL, NATURAL-ORIGIN DISEASE CONTROL PRODUCT AVAILABLE FOR COMMERCIAL SALE IN CANADA, SOUTH KOREA AND AUSTRALIA INDIANAPOLIS , MARCH 28, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- CORTEVA AGRISCIENCE ANNOUNCED TODAY THE COMMERCIAL LAUNCH OF ADAVELT™ ACTIVE, WITH RECENT PRODUCT REGISTRATIONS IN THREE COUNTRIES – AUSTRALIA, CANADA AND SOUTH KOREA. ADAVELT ACTIVE IS A NOVEL FUNGICIDE WITH A NEW MODE OF ACTION THAT PROTECTS AGAINST A WIDE RANGE OF DISEASES THAT CAN IMPACT CROP YIELDS.'}